  "answer": "In the RAG-Sequence model, the same retrieved document is used to generate the complete target sequence, treating the retrieved document as a single latent variable [rag_lewis_2020.pdf p.3]. In contrast, the RAG-Token model can draw a different latent document for each target token, allowing the generator to combine content from multiple documents when producing an answer [rag_lewis_2020.pdf p.3].",
